  "description": "After a painful rejection, Lee Cheong-Myeong did everything he could to keep his distance from his handsome next-door neighbor, Kwon Sa-Heon. But plans change when college acceptance lands Cheong-Myeong right back under the same roof as Sa-Heon, forcing them into a sudden living-together dynamic. \n\nOnly, the rules of their relationship have changed. The sweet, perfect hyung is no longer keeping his distance. Instead, Sa-Heon begins pulling Cheong-Myeong into a dizzying maze of intense physical boundaries and mixed signals. Caught between lingering heartache and a sudden surge of heat, Cheong-Myeong is left questioning where the line between brotherly care and raw obsession truly lies.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
